---
// 4.4 — Release as open source: flywheel diagram
---

<div class="flywheel-wrap">
  <div class="flywheel-label">The Open-Source Flywheel</div>
  <div class="flywheel-diagram">
    <div class="fw-step fw-step-1">
      <div class="fw-num">01</div>
      <div class="fw-text">Community builds<br />original tool</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fw-connector fw-connector-right">→</div>
    <div class="fw-step fw-step-2">
      <div class="fw-num">02</div>
      <div class="fw-text">AI-assisted<br />rewrite created</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fw-connector fw-connector-down">↓</div>
    <div class="fw-step fw-step-4">
      <div class="fw-num">04</div>
      <div class="fw-text">Insights feed back<br />to original tool</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fw-connector fw-connector-left">←</div>
    <div class="fw-step fw-step-3">
      <div class="fw-num">03</div>
      <div class="fw-text">Community benefits,<br />contributes, improves</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flywheel-note">
    Closed-source rewrites break this loop. They extract value from the community without returning it.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .flywheel-wrap {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--section-color, var(--accent-rust));
    border-top: none;
    border-right: none;
    border-bottom: none;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .flywheel-label {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .flywheel-diagram {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
    align-items: center;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .fw-step {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.1);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .fw-step-1 { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; border-color: rgba(194, 81, 46, 0.2); }
  .fw-step-2 { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; border-color: rgba(93, 172, 114, 0.2); }
  .fw-step-3 { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 3; border-color: rgba(93, 172, 114, 0.15); }
  .fw-step-4 { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 3; border-color: rgba(194, 81, 46, 0.15); }

  .fw-connector {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .fw-connector-right { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
  .fw-connector-down  { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 2; }
  .fw-connector-left  { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 3; }

  .fw-num {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-rust);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .fw-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .flywheel-note {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.06);
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
